  "resume": "This document is a parliamentary motion and its corresponding message recorded during the Winter Session 2011–2015, specifically for the Spring Session 2012, concerning a request for an annual credit increase of at least 6 percent for the Swiss Film Fund (BFI) over the period 2013–2016. The motion was presented by Anita Fetz and debated by listed members of the Council of States. The record is a video recording of the debate."
